      "content": "AI & Machine Learning | Google Cloud Blog AI & Machine Learning Find news, updates, and best practices for AI and machine learning solutions on Google Cloud. AI & Machine Learning Introducing Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform, powering the next wave of agents Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform is our new platform to build, scale, govern, and optimize agents. It integrates the model selection, model building, and agent building capabilities of Vertex AI, with new features for agent integration, DevOps, and orchestration, and security. By Michael Gerstenhaber • 12-minute read Read article AI & Machine Learning The new Gemini Enterprise: one platform for agent development, orchestration, and governance By Brian Delahunty • 7-minute read AI & Machine Learning What Google Cloud announced in AI this month By Andrea Sanin • 17-minute read News in short A quick take on updates, announcements, resources, events, and learning opportunities from Google Cloud in one handy location. Updated weekly. Read now Developers & Practitioners Gemini Live Agent Challenge: Announcing the winners and highlights By Dilasha Panigrahi • 6-minute read Security & Identity Cloud CISO Perspectives: How Google + Wiz changes multicloud strategy for CISOs By Vinod D’Souza • 6-minute read AI & Machine Learning Google Named a Leader in the Gartner® Magic Quadrant™ for AI Application Development Platforms: Mid-cycle update By Mike Clark • 5-minute read Data Analytics The power of LLMs on your data, more than two orders of magnitude faster and cheaper By Thibaud Hottelier • 11-minute read Infrastructure How Imgix processes 8 billion images daily with G4 VMs powered by NVIDIA Blackwell By Abhijeet Rajwade • 6-minute read Security & Identity Beyond source code: The files AI coding agents trust — and attackers exploit By Bernardo Quintero • 9-minute read Storage & Data Transfer Cloud Storage Rapid: Turbocharged object storage for AI and analytics By Marco Abela • 7-minute read Compute Cluster